== Effect ==
* Reveals on the map what type of [[room]] all rooms adjacent to your current room are (Shop, Sacrifice Room, etc.).
** Can also reveal {{r|Secret Room}}s, {{r|Super Secret Room}}s, and {{r|Mini-Boss Room}}s.
** {{Dlc|r}} Reveals rooms up to 2 rooms away.
* {{Dlc|r}} Blocks projectiles falling from above.
** Cannot block Mom's Foot or other stomp attacks.

