== Trivia ==
* The item is a reference to the game [[wikipedia:Spelunky|Spelunky]].
* Despite being a light source such as the {{I|Night Light}}, this item does not project a beam of light.
* In the original ''Binding of Isaac'', Spelunker Hat was not unlocked by default and had to be unlocked by beating The Caves for the first time.

